         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Four Ways to Count to Ten\n\nIn our previous classes, we learned to count with our hands. We counted **two hands with five fingers**: **5 × 2 = 10**. We also counted our ten fingers **one by one**: **10 × 1 = 10**.\n\nThose are two ways to reach ten… but is that all? In this class, we are going to discover that there are actually **four different ways** to group the ten! Let us find them together with the help of squares.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
