         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Squares Going Up\n\nTake a rectangle made of ten squares. Look at it carefully: going up, it has **5 lines**; going across, it has **2 columns**.\n\nCount the squares line by line: **2 + 2 + 2 + 2 + 2 = 10**.\n\nWith multiplication, we write **5 × 2 = 10**: five lines, each one with two squares.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
