         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Squares Lying Down\n\nNow let us turn the rectangle around. Now it has **2 lines** and **5 columns**.\n\nCount the squares line by line: **5 + 5 = 10**.\n\nWith multiplication, we write **2 × 5 = 10**: two lines, each one with five squares.\n\nOnly the position changed. The squares are the same!",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><svg width=\"240\" height=\"96\" viewBox=\"0 0 240 96\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g transform=\"translate(0,0)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#2C3E50\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"48\" y=\"0\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#2C3E50\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"96\" y=\"0\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#2C3E50\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"144\" y=\"0\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#2C3E50\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"192\" y=\"0\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#2C3E50\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"0\" y=\"48\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#2C3E50\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"48\" y=\"48\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#2C3E50\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"96\" y=\"48\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#2C3E50\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"144\" y=\"48\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#2C3E50\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"192\" y=\"48\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" stroke=\"#2C3E50\" stroke-width=\"3\"/></g></svg></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Graphic 2: The same rectangle, now with 2 lines and 5 columns — ten squares in total.</b></p>",
